### ========================================================
### 1. UJI VALIDASI BEAN (DATA CACAT DITOLAK OTOMATIS)
### ========================================================

### 1.1 UJI VALIDASI USER: Email Cacat & Nama Kosong
# Ekspektasi: 400 Bad Request dengan rincian field error:
# - "name": "Nama tidak boleh kosong!"
# - "email": "Format email tidak valid!"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "bukan-alamat-email",
  "role": "BUYER"
}

### 1.2 UJI VALIDASI PRODUK: Harga Negatif, Nama Kosong & Stok Minus
# Ekspektasi: 400 Bad Request dengan rincian 3 field error:
# - "name": "Nama produk tidak boleh kosong!"
# - "price": "Harga produk harus lebih besar dari 0!"
# - "stock": "Stok produk tidak boleh bernilai negatif!"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "Barang cacat",
  "price": -50000.0,
  "stock": -10,
  "category": "Minuman",
  "sellerId": 1
}


### ========================================================
### 2. DATA VALID (SUKSES DITERIMA)
### ========================================================

### 2.1 Buka Toko yang Valid (SELLER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Toko Kopi Nusantara",
  "email": "kopinusantara@mail.com",
  "role": "SELLER"
}

### 2.2 Upload Produk yang Valid (Harga Positif, Stok Valid)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Gayo Arabika",
  "description": "Biji kopi sangrai 250g",
  "price": 85000.0,
  "stock": 50,
  "category": "Minuman",
  "sellerId": 1
}

### 2.3 Lihat Hasil Katalog (Paging)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?page=0&size=10
